/-!
# Fixed-quantum amplitude--time cascade on the actual whole restart run

Every half-critical crossing already generates a finite pre-quotient set of
Fourier rows and a positive interval on which at least half of the fixed
whole-tangent quantum is paid.  This module makes that existential output a
source-owned total receipt, translates every receipt to the single physical
time axis, and accumulates the exact amplitude--time responsibility before
any occurrence quotient.

The construction accepts no modes, time window, modulus, cutoff, branch,
margin, payment bound, or continuation witness from a caller.
-/

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace NavierStokes
namespace
    ThreeDimensionalVorticityCoefficientGeneratedWholeRestartCrossingTangentQuantumCascade

open scoped BigOperators Interval

open Set MeasureTheory
open ThreeDimensionalPeriodicIntegerCharacterCoarseFilter
open ThreeDimensionalPeriodicFilteredNavierStokesGenerator
